# Static site conventions

- Prefer editing existing pages/patterns over new frameworks.
- Keep `content/site.json` and `content/company.json` as the source of truth for emails and company facts.
- Free-plan CTAs → `/contact.html?intent=free-plan` or `#plan-tool` on homepage.
- Shop: interest catalog only; never enable a fake cart.
- After homepage / contact / shop / journey changes, run:

```bash
node --test scripts/homepage-render.test.cjs scripts/plan-tool.test.cjs scripts/shop.test.cjs scripts/inquiry-privacy.test.cjs scripts/journey-language.test.cjs
```

- Match cache-bust query strings on CSS/JS when behavior visibly changes.
